{"version":"6.9","hitCount":1,"request":{"queryString":"EXT_ID:23742060 AND SRC:MED","internalQuery":"EXT_ID:23742060 AND SRC:MED","resultType":"CORE","cursorMark":"*","pageSize":25,"sort":"","synonym":false},"resultList":{"result":[{"id":"23742060","source":"MED","pmid":"23742060","doi":"10.1080/15257770.2013.789107","title":"Nucleoside 5'-phosphorothioate derivatives as oxidative stress protectants in PC12 cells.","authorString":"Danino O, Grossman S, Fischer B.","authorList":{"author":[{"fullName":"Danino O","firstName":"Ortal","lastName":"Danino","initials":"O","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Chemistry, Bar-Ilan University, Ramat-Gan, Israel."}]}},{"fullName":"Grossman S","firstName":"Shlomo","lastName":"Grossman","initials":"S"},{"fullName":"Fischer B","firstName":"Bilha","lastName":"Fischer","initials":"B"}]},"journalInfo":{"issue":"7","volume":"32","journalIssueId":2046545,"dateOfPublication":"2013 ","monthOfPublication":0,"yearOfPublication":2013,"printPublicationDate":"2013-01-01","journal":{"title":"Nucleosides, nucleotides & nucleic acids","medlineAbbreviation":"Nucleosides Nucleotides Nucleic Acids","essn":"1532-2335","issn":"1525-7770","isoabbreviation":"Nucleosides Nucleotides Nucleic Acids","nlmid":"100892832"}},"pubYear":"2013","pageInfo":"333-353","abstractText":"Iron-induced oxidative damage of mitochondria contributes to cellular death seen in neurodegenerative diseases, therefore, there is a demand for nontoxic, biocompatible, and effective Fe-ion chelators. We evaluated the chelation of Fe(II) by phosphate derivatives using ferrozine as an indicator. We studied the effect of phosphate derivatives on inhibiting Fe(II)-induced oxidative stress in PC12 cells, and metabolic stability in PC12 cells was evaluated. Nucleotides containing phosphorothioate moieties inhibited ROS formation better than natural nucleotides and were more metabolically stable in PC12 cells. Finally, we elucidated that these nucleotides activate the MAP-kinase pathway that contributes to protection of PC12 cells under oxidative stress.","affiliation":"Department of Chemistry, Bar-Ilan University, Ramat-Gan, Israel.","publicationStatus":"ppublish","language":"eng","pubModel":"Print","pubTypeList":{"pubType":["Journal Article"]},"meshHeadingList":{"meshHeading":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"PC12 Cells"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Animals"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Rats"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Ferrous Compounds","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"abbreviation":"ME","qualifierName":"metabolism","majorTopic_YN":"N"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Reactive Oxygen Species","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"abbreviation":"ME","qualifierName":"metabolism","majorTopic_YN":"N"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Antioxidants","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"abbreviation":"ME","qualifierName":"metabolism","majorTopic_YN":"N"},{"abbreviation":"PD","qualifierName":"pharmacology","majorTopic_YN":"Y"},{"abbreviation":"CH","qualifierName":"chemistry","majorTopic_YN":"Y"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Cell Survival","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"abbreviation":"DE","qualifierName":"drug effects","majorTopic_YN":"N"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"MAP Kinase Signaling System","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"abbreviation":"DE","qualifierName":"drug effects","majorTopic_YN":"N"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Oxidative Stress","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"abbreviation":"DE","qualifierName":"drug effects","majorTopic_YN":"Y"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Phosphorothioate Oligonucleotides","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"abbreviation":"ME","qualifierName":"metabolism","majorTopic_YN":"N"},{"abbreviation":"PD","qualifierName":"pharmacology","majorTopic_YN":"Y"},{"abbreviation":"CH","qualifierName":"chemistry","majorTopic_YN":"Y"}]}}]},"chemi